===Noun===
{{en-noun|es}}

# {{lb|en|chiefly|UK}} A collection point for mail intended for onward delivery, a [[secure]] [[box]] or [[receptacle]] for this purpose.
# {{lb|en|chiefly|UK}} A delivery point for mail, a [[box]], [[compartment]] or [[slot]] for this purpose.
# A hidden container that holds a logbook and rubber stamp which is found by following clues.

